==Battleground==
*1 [[Misaki Konno (Enemy)|Misaki Konno]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A straightforward stage: most of the enemies here are high-pressure pushers that can be stalled with lots of cheap meatshields. Bring ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs Cat]], as they comfortably strike most enemis from a safe distance. The Gories will provide you with ample cash, just be sure not too push too hard into THE SLOTH's attacking range and you should be fine. Super Rares like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]], they will help with damage a lot.

